       "text": "I haven't entered this order yet. I need you to confirm the dose first.\n\n**Sertraline 1000 mg daily is 5 times the maximum recommended dose.** Adult sertraline usually starts at 25\u201350 mg once daily, and the maximum is 200 mg/day. At 1000 mg, the risks include serotonin syndrome, QT prolongation and seizures.\n\nThis may be a typo for **100 mg** once daily. Could you confirm which you meant?\n\n- **100 mg PO once daily**: I'll enter it right away.\n- **Another dose within 25\u2013200 mg**: tell me the dose.\n- **1000 mg was intended**: please give the clinical reason. I'll put it in the order note so pharmacy can review it."
